Package: lsw
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gcc, make
Description: Linux Subsystem for Windows
 LSW brings Windows 11 to Linux the same way WSL brought Linux to
 Windows. Includes the NTLL (NT Layer Library) runtime: a PE32+
 loader, NT syscall translation layer, and Win32 API implementation
 with zero dependency on Wine.